### Manual demo (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client). Run against a fresh database for the expected totals.
@base = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Initial submission -> 201 CREATED
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trades
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-1-initial

{ "external_ref": "TRX-1001", "account_id": "ACC-001", "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005", "symbol": "AAPL" },
  "side": "BUY", "quantity": 120, "price": 185.40, "trade_date": "2025-03-01", "as_of": "2025-03-01T10:15:00Z" }

### 2. Re-send (same external_ref and as_of) -> 200 DUPLICATE
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "external_ref": "TRX-1001", "account_id": "ACC-001", "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005", "symbol": "AAPL" },
  "side": "BUY", "quantity": 120, "price": 185.40, "trade_date": "2025-03-01", "as_of": "2025-03-01T10:15:00Z" }

### 3. Correction (later as_of, changed quantity/price) -> 200 CORRECTED, version 2
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "external_ref": "TRX-1001", "account_id": "ACC-001", "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005" },
  "side": "BUY", "quantity": 100, "price": 185.20, "trade_date": "2025-03-01", "as_of": "2025-03-01T14:00:00Z" }

### 4. ZAR trade (converted to USD via USD-ZAR 18.72) -> 201 CREATED
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "external_ref": "TRX-1002", "account_id": "ACC-001", "instrument": { "isin": "ZAE000015889" },
  "side": "BUY", "quantity": 50, "price": 4450, "trade_date": "2025-03-01", "as_of": "2025-03-01T10:30:00Z" }

### 5. Snapshot (latest corrected view) -> total_value_usd 30619.23
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/ACC-001/snapshot?date=2025-03-01

### 6. Snapshot as known before the correction -> total_value_usd 34339.23
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/ACC-001/snapshot?date=2025-03-01&known_at=2025-03-01T12:00:00Z

### 7. Audit trail
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trades/TRX-1001

### 8. Recent ingestion events for the account
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/ACC-001/events?take=20

### 9. Reference data
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isin": "US0378331005", "date": "2025-03-04", "price": 190.10, "currency": "USD" }

###
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/fx-rates
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "USD-ZAR", "date": "2025-03-04", "rate": 18.55 }

### 10. Rollout state
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/correction-handling?account=ACC-001

### Validation error -> 400 with snake_case field names
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "external_ref": "", "account_id": "ACC-001", "instrument": {}, "side": "HOLD", "quantity": -5 }
